        { type: 'p', text: "It's easy to see how the three aspects of wellness are related. When you are ill or facing many problems, your relationships with friends and family may suffer; if you are worried about a difficult exam, you may get a headache or stomachache. This view of wellness as a combination of physical, mental, and social well-being is known as a holistic concept of health — holistic means \"whole,\" and it refers to the connections among these three aspects as they affect the whole person." }
