        { type: 'p', text: "Finally, awareness and knowledge aren't enough without skill — much like a baseball team that studies the game constantly but never practices won't win many games. A habit is a pattern of behavior that has become automatic and hard to break, but it's possible to replace old habits with new skills through practice, until the new skills feel just as natural." }
